{
  "info": {
    "name": "knowledge-hub 知识库 API",
    "description": "knowledge-hub 全量接口集合（文档摄取 + RAG 发布检索）。\n\n## 导入方式\nApifox → 项目 → 导入 → 选择 Postman 集合（本文件）→ 确认。\n导入后右上角切换到「开发环境」，baseUrl 默认 http://localhost:3000。\n\n## 推荐测试顺序\n1. 健康检查 —— 确认服务已启动\n2. 创建文档 —— 成功后从响应复制 data.id，填到集合变量 docId\n3. 发布文档（RAG）—— status 变为 1 且 indexed=true，表示已写入 ES kh_chunk\n4. 混合检索（块级）—— 用刚才文档里的关键词验证语义召回\n5. 文档级搜索 —— /search/documents 验证关键词命中与 highlight 高亮\n6. 删除文档 —— 验证 vectorsCleaned / searchCleaned 均为 true（联动清理两条 ES 索引）\n\n## 注意事项\n- 所有响应统一信封：{ code, message, data, timestamp }，code=200/201 为成功\n- 阶段一发布是**同步执行**（无消息队列），长文档可能耗时数秒\n- mode=vector/hybrid 依赖 EMBEDDING_API_KEY；未配置时返回空数组且不报错\n- 上传解析接口为 multipart/form-data，字段名固定为 file，需在 Body 里重新选择本地文件\n- 路径参数用集合变量 {{docId}}，改一处即可全局生效",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "docId",
      "value": "359687696760705024"
    },
    {
      "key": "keyword",
      "value": "年假"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "系统",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "健康检查",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "确认服务是否可用。返回 {\"status\":\"ok\"} 即正常。\n若连接失败：确认服务已启动（默认 3000 端口）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "根路径",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "占位接口，返回 Hello World，仅用于确认路由已注册。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "文档管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "创建文档（草稿）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"费用报销管理制度\",\n  \"content\": \"# 费用报销管理制度\\n\\n## 第一章 总则\\n\\n为规范公司费用报销流程，特制定本制度。员工因公产生的差旅费、交通费、业务招待费均可申请报销。\\n\\n## 第二章 报销标准\\n\\n差旅费报销标准：一线城市住宿费每日不超过600元，二线城市不超过400元。交通费凭票据实报销。\\n\\n## 第三章 审批流程\\n\\n报销单需经部门负责人审批后提交财务部审核，金额超过5000元的需总经理审批。发票必须在一个月内提交。\",\n  \"summary\": \"差旅、住宿与报销审批标准\",\n  \"tags\": \"财务,制度\",\n  \"status\": 0,\n  \"isPublic\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents"
              ]
            },
            "description": "双写：MongoDB 存正文，PostgreSQL 存元数据。\n\nstatus 枚举：0 草稿 / 1 已发布 / 2 已归档。默认 0。\n\n✅ 成功后从响应的 data.id 复制雪花 ID，填到集合变量 docId。\n\n注：fileUrl/objectKey 等文件字段由上传链路写入，手工创建时为 null，属正常。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "文档列表（分页）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents?page=1&pageSize=20&title=&status=",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "页码，从 1 开始"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "每页条数，最大 100"
                },
                {
                  "key": "title",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "标题模糊搜索，留空则不过滤"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "0 草稿 / 1 已发布 / 2 已归档，留空则不过滤"
                },
                {
                  "key": "categoryId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "teamId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "authorId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "仅返回元数据，不含正文。\n\n不需要的过滤条件可勾选取消（Apifox 里点参数前的复选框）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "文档详情（含正文）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents",
                "{{docId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "返回元数据 + Mongo 正文 content。\n\n务必确认 data.id 与集合变量 docId 一致。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "更新文档",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"费用报销管理制度（2026修订版）\",\n  \"summary\": \"更新后的摘要\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents",
                "{{docId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "局部更新，字段均可选。\n\n⚠️ 重要：通过本接口把 status 改成 1 **不会触发 RAG 索引**，\n只有 PUT /documents/:id/publish 会触发。\n\n带 content 时会同步更新 Mongo 正文并递增 version。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "删除文档（软删除）",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents",
                "{{docId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "软删除：kh_document.deleted=true + Mongo 正文 deleted=true，不物理删数据。\n同时清理两条 ES 索引：\n- vectorsCleaned：kh_chunk 向量块已清理\n- searchCleaned：kh_document 搜索记录已清理\n\n跨系统无事务，清理失败只记日志、不阻断删除；检索侧另有 PG 复核兜底。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "文件上传解析",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "上传文件并解析为 Markdown",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "apps/server/test/fixtures/李先生_28岁_76761.pdf",
                  "description": "必填。支持 PDF / DOCX / XLSX / PPTX / TXT / MD，单文件上限 50MB"
                },
                {
                  "key": "categoryId",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "teamId",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "authorId",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "tags",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "remark",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "isPublic",
                  "value": "false",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents",
                "upload",
                "parse"
              ]
            },
            "description": "上传 → 解析为 Markdown → 创建**草稿**文档（status=0）。\n\n⚠️ 导入后请在 Body → form-data 里**重新选择本地文件**（原 src 路径不可用）。\n项目自带夹具：apps/server/test/fixtures/ 下有 PDF/DOCX/XLSX/PPTX 样例。\n\n成功后同样从 data.id 取文档 ID 填到变量 docId，再调用「发布文档」。\n\n源文件会存到 RustFS，元数据写入 file_url / object_key / file_name / file_size / file_extension 五列。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "RAG 发布与重建索引",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "发布文档并触发 RAG 索引",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}/publish",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "documents",
                "{{docId}}",
                "publish"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**核心接口**。设为已发布后同步执行两条索引：\n1. RAG：分块 → Embedding（qwen3.7-flash, 1024维）→ 写入 ES kh_chunk\n2. Search：整篇快照 → 写入 ES kh_document\n\n响应字段：\n- indexed / chunks：RAG 链路（需要 ES + EMBEDDING_API_KEY）\n- searchIndexed：文档级搜索链路（**只需要 ES**）\n\n两条链路可用性分开判定：没配 Embedding Key 时 indexed=false 但 searchIndexed 仍可能为 true。\n幂等：两条索引都以文档 ID 为 _id 覆盖写，重复发布不会增长。\n阶段一为同步调用，长文档可能耗时数秒。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "重建全部已发布文档（全量重索引）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rag/reindex",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rag",
                "reindex"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**换 embedding 模型后必须执行**：不同模型的向量空间不兼容，旧向量与新查询比对无意义。\n省略 documentIds 即重建全部「已发布且未删除」的文档。\n返回 { taskId, queued }，任务由 BullMQ Worker 异步执行（publish 本身仍是同步的）。\n前置：REDIS_ENABLED=true 且 Redis 已启动，否则返回 503。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "重建指定文档",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentIds\": [\"{{docId}}\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rag/reindex",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rag",
                "reindex"
              ]
            },
            "description": "只重建指定文档。管线幂等（先清旧块再按 chunkId 覆盖写），重复执行安全。\n前置同全量重建。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "知识检索",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "混合检索 hybrid（GET，推荐）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search?query={{keyword}}&mode=hybrid&topK=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "{{keyword}}",
                  "description": "查询词，必填"
                },
                {
                  "key": "mode",
                  "value": "hybrid",
                  "description": "hybrid 混合 / vector 纯向量 / keyword 纯关键词"
                },
                {
                  "key": "topK",
                  "value": "5",
                  "description": "返回条数 1-50"
                },
                {
                  "key": "categoryId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "teamId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "authorId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "推荐默认用法：kNN 向量 + BM25 关键词双路召回，应用层 RRF 融合。\n\n返回结构要点：\n- score：RRF 融合分（Σ1/(60+rank)），量级 0.0x 是正常的\n- scores.vector / scores.keyword：两路原始分数，可用于对比调优\n- 结果只含 doc_status=1 的文档，且会回查 Postgres 过滤已删文档\n\n改上面的集合变量 keyword 即可换查询词试试。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "纯向量检索 vector（GET）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search?query=出差住宿能报销多少&mode=vector&topK=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "出差住宿能报销多少",
                  "description": "语义查询，用词可与原文不同"
                },
                {
                  "key": "mode",
                  "value": "vector"
                },
                {
                  "key": "topK",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "纯语义召回，验证向量能力：查询词可以与原文用词完全不同。\n\n⚠️ 低于 RAG_MIN_SCORE（默认 0.72）的结果会被丢弃——\nkNN 必然返回 topK 条，没有门槛会把无关内容也带出来。\n\n未配置 EMBEDDING_API_KEY 时返回空数组且不报错。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "纯关键词检索 keyword（GET）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search?query={{keyword}}&mode=keyword&topK=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "{{keyword}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "mode",
                  "value": "keyword"
                },
                {
                  "key": "topK",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "BM25 + IK 中文分词，不依赖 Embedding Key，随时可用。\n\n与 vector 模式对比即可看出两路召回的差异。\n无词项匹配时会返回空数组（这是正常的，说明 IK 没匹配上）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "混合检索 hybrid（POST）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"出差住宿能报销多少\",\n  \"mode\": \"hybrid\",\n  \"topK\": 5\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST 版。查询词含特殊字符或较长时用 POST 更稳妥。\n\n校验规则：query 必填；mode 只能是 hybrid/vector/keyword；topK 整数 1-50。\n多余字段会被拒绝（全局启用了 forbidNonWhitelisted）。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "文档级全文搜索（ES kh_document）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "文档检索（GET，带高亮）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search/documents?query={{keyword}}&page=1&pageSize=10",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search",
                "documents"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "{{keyword}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**文档级检索**：返回整篇文档列表（区别于 /search 的块级片段）。\n\n响应 hits[].highlight 为 ES 高亮片段（默认 <em> 标签），snippet 优先取 content 高亮，无高亮时退化为正文前 200 字。\n\n默认 status=1（只召回已发布文档）；显式传 status 可覆盖（0 草稿 / 1 已发布 / 2 已归档）。\nES 不可用时返回空结果而非报错。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "文档检索（POST）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"{{keyword}}\",\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/search/documents",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "search",
                "documents"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST 版。查询词较长或含特殊字符时用 POST 更稳妥。\n\n可选字段：categoryId / authorId / teamId / status（0-2）。\n校验：pageSize 整数 1-50；未知字段会被拒绝（全局 forbidNonWhitelisted）。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
